<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Verify Your Account - AffinityEcho</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #4b5563; margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f3f4f6;">
    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: white; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);">
        <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #9333ea 0%, #4f46e5 50%, #3b82f6 100%); padding: 40px; text-align: center; color: white;">
            <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700;">Complete Your Registration</h1>
            <p style="margin: 10px 0 0; opacity: 0.9; font-size: 16px;">AffinityEcho - Verify Your Account</p>
        </div>

        <div style="padding: 40px;">
            <h2 style="color: #111827; margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 22px;">Welcome to AffinityEcho!</h2>
            <p>Hello <strong style="color: #9333ea;"><%= username %></strong>,</p>
            <p>Thank you for joining our community! To complete your registration, please use the verification code below:</p>

            <div style="background: #faf5ff; border: 2px solid #9333ea; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; font-size: 42px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 12px; color: #9333ea; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
                <%= otp %>
            </div>

            <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563; margin: 20px 0;">Enter this 6-digit code on the verification page to activate your account.</p>

            <div style="background: #faf5ff; border: 1px solid #e9d5ff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 25px 0;">
                <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: #9333ea; font-weight: 600;">What happens after verification?</p>
                <ul style="margin: 0; color: #4b5563; padding-left: 20px;">
                    <li>Complete your anonymous profile setup</li>
                    <li>Join affinity groups that match your background</li>
                    <li>Access company-specific forums</li>
                    <li>Start finding mentorship opportunities</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div style="background: #fef3c7; border: 1px solid #fde68a; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 25px 0;">
                <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: #92400e; font-weight: 600;">Security Information</p>
                <ul style="margin: 0; color: #92400e; padding-left: 20px;">
                    <li>This code will expire in 15 minutes</li>
                    <li>Do not share this code with anyone</li>
                    <li>AffinityEcho will never ask for this code via phone or email</li>
                    <li>If you didn't create an account, please ignore this email</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #f9fafb; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px; color: #9ca3af; font-size: 14px;">This verification code was sent as part of your account registration.</p>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af;">Need help? Contact us at <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>" style="color: #4f46e5;"><%= supportEmail %></a></p>
            <p style="margin: 12px 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af;">&copy; 2025 AffinityEcho. Building stronger professionals together.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
